  "name": "hotosm_tls_financial_services",
  "notes": "Financial services from OSM. Includes banks, ATMs, post offices, money transfer agents, and microfinance branches tagged via `amenity`. Useful for financial-inclusion mapping, cash-distribution planning, and economic analysis.\n\nOpenStreetMap is a free, collaborative world map built by volunteers. Completeness varies by region: urban areas are usually well-mapped, remote areas may be incomplete. Cross-check critical decisions with local field knowledge.\n\n- Source: [OpenStreetMap](https://www.openstreetmap.org)\n- OSM tags: [Key:amenity](https://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:amenity)\n- Part of many  [exports grid on HDX](https://data.humdata.org/organization/hot) by the [HOT](https://www.hotosm.org/en/)\n",
